  "known_local_policies": [
    "Redemption creates a new printed resurrection from the original friendly DeathRecord, not a move of the old corpse. It retains printed maximum Health and assigns damage for1 remaining Health after the shared aura refresh, matching the existing Reborn entry window.",
    "Emergency Maneuvers uses the existing full-health current death-copy material and creates1-turn dormancy through the original allocator before entry reactions; no fake self-Deathrattle invocation is manufactured.",
    "The original minion can already have moved from its graveyard residence. Immutable death/source facts remain authoritative for these non-consuming copies; the prior physical hand-return guard is unchanged by default.",
    "At-death buffs, silence, attachment and damage-reset semantics reuse the current death-copy contract. Exact original reaction order, printed-dormancy priority and permanent-dormancy exceptions remain explicit local boundaries.",
    "Historical2022 first-person reports describe a printed Wildseed3-turn dormancy overriding the requested1. Current local policy explicitly uses the requested1 for supported timed copies; permanent printed dormancy is rejected before delivery rather than filtered from a pool.",
    "TSC_929t is kept as complete read-only improved-Secret evidence. Its Tavish producer is not a current registered Standard root or verified reachable source in this batch; it is not claimed executable or silently added to the72 collectible candidate list."
